525
00:15:33,867 --> 00:15:35,400
- [Tom] 'Cause I'm gonna
What are you doing?

526
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,600
coach you with bear grease.
- Waiting for you to ask me

527
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,967
