- [Joel] I just did!

528
00:15:38,967 --> 00:15:42,067
- (chuckles) Well, the gang
have gone down to the cafeteria.

529
00:15:42,067 --> 00:15:43,000
Would you like to join 'em?

530
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:43,800
- [Joel] For some Wilding?

531
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:45,033
