535
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:52,567
- [Tom] Oh, I love it
when he calls me James!

536
00:15:53,633 --> 00:15:55,133
- [Joel] Aw, she's the ginchest!

537
00:15:55,133 --> 00:15:57,000
Life does begin at 40!

538
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,300
- [Tom] And let's see. (grunts)

539
00:16:01,300 --> 00:16:04,467
Oo, that bursitis is
really acting up today!

540
00:16:04,467 --> 00:16:06,133
- [Crow] I'm gonna
have to take a sweater!

541
00:16:06,133 --> 00:16:08,433
My legs are old,
my teeth are gray.

542
00:16:08,433 --> 00:16:11,333
(traffic whooshes)

543
00:16:16,067 --> 00:16:18,067
- [Tom] Oh, good brakes!

544
00:16:20,700 --> 00:16:22,933
- [Lewis] Gee, you must
have jets on this heap!

545
00:16:22,933 --> 00:16:25,000
- My launching pad is
only three blocks away,

546
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:25,967
