- [Joel] Oo!

547
00:16:25,967 --> 00:16:27,167
- [Lewis] Yeah!

548
00:16:27,167 --> 00:16:28,500
- [Joel] Yeah don't
get me started.

549
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:29,933
My missile's ready to fire!

550
00:16:29,933 --> 00:16:31,333
- [Crow] The Shadow
has cleared the tower!

551
00:16:31,333 --> 00:16:32,667
- (mutters) To the moon!
- [Betty] To the moon!

552
00:16:32,667 --> 00:16:33,633
- [Tom] To the moon,

553
00:16:33,633 --> 00:16:34,633
Alice.

554
00:16:34,633 --> 00:16:36,000
- Can't we spend
a quiet evening?

555
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,033
Like, alone?

556
00:16:37,033 --> 00:16:37,967
- [Tom] What do you mean?

557
00:16:37,967 --> 00:16:38,767
Alone alone
(Lewis mumbles)

558
00:16:38,767 --> 00:16:40,300
or metaphorically alone?

559
00:16:40,300 --> 00:16:41,833
- The fellas oughta all be
together in case he does!

560
00:16:41,833 --> 00:16:44,567
You know, the autopsy's being
conducted at City Morgue and

561
00:16:44,567 --> 00:16:47,100
John Does don't grow
on slabs every day!

562
00:16:47,100 --> 00:16:48,900
(robots chuckles)
- We wouldn't be gone long.

563
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:50,200
- [Joel] If I know you!

564
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:52,033
- Okay, we go for a short drive,

565
00:16:52,033 --> 00:16:53,033
moonlight

566
00:16:53,033 --> 00:16:54,733
and then to the cafeteria!

567
00:16:54,733 --> 00:16:58,633
(Joel and robots
purr and screech)

568
00:16:58,633 --> 00:17:01,367
(engine rumbles)

569
00:17:02,567 --> 00:17:05,467
(muffled shouting)

570
00:17:08,167 --> 00:17:11,067
(muffled wailing)

571
00:17:11,067 --> 00:17:12,700
- [Joel] Oh.

572
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:14,767
The dump again?

573
00:17:14,767 --> 00:17:15,700
- [Tom] It's not a dump!

574
00:17:15,700 --> 00:17:17,100
It's a sanitary landfill!

575
00:17:17,100 --> 00:17:19,167
Obviously, a joke.

576
00:17:19,167 --> 00:17:22,333
(piano music)
- [Joel] Bob has a problem.

577
00:17:22,333 --> 00:17:25,233
(Tom scatting)
Bob wasn't careful, you see,

578
00:17:25,233 --> 00:17:27,800
so he's paying the price.

579
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:30,600
- [Crow] I just love
these outdoor piano bars!

580
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:33,000
- [Betty] Aren't they lovely?

581
00:17:38,833 --> 00:17:40,033
(twig snaps)
- [Tom] Uh, ow, eh!

582
00:17:40,033 --> 00:17:41,333
How would you like it

583
00:17:41,333 --> 00:17:43,833
if somebody picked
apples off of you?

584
00:17:43,833 --> 00:17:44,767
- [Joel] Have you
ever been whipped

585
00:17:44,767 --> 00:17:47,000
