586
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:51,400
(Tom mumbles)
(crickets chirp)

587
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:53,400
(robot murmuring)
- [Joel] Uh, excuse me.

588
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:54,633
Excuse me?

589
00:17:54,633 --> 00:17:56,067
- [Tom] You forgot to
put your teeth in, Jim.

590
00:17:56,067 --> 00:17:57,967
- I wish you were studying
law or architecture

591
