anything except medicine!

592
00:18:00,867 --> 00:18:02,700
- [Tom] My mother wanted me
to marry a street musician!

593
00:18:02,700 --> 00:18:04,000
- Just because your
father was a doctor,

594
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:06,333
