- [Tom] I'm old!

599
00:18:14,367 --> 00:18:15,600
(Lewis mumbles)
I've got a practice!

600
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:17,500
I've been a respected
doctor for 20 years!

601
00:18:17,500 --> 00:18:19,367
- I'm not afraid of any of it!

602
00:18:19,367 --> 00:18:21,033
I'm not afraid of the
blood or the corpses

603
00:18:21,033 --> 00:18:22,600
