interested in all that.

609
00:18:29,933 --> 00:18:32,000
- It's my fault, darling.

610
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:34,367
I'll never bring up
the subject again!

611
00:18:34,367 --> 00:18:36,867
- [Crow] I'm that codependent!

612
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:41,367
(robots slurping)

613
00:18:41,367 --> 00:18:43,567
(horror music)
- [Joel] Hi, I'm Satan!

614
00:18:43,567 --> 00:18:45,467
This is what happens when
you do the hanky panky

615
