616
00:18:46,933 --> 00:18:48,100
Let's watch the fun!

617
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:49,733
Really!

618
00:18:49,733 --> 00:18:54,167
(Crow slurps)
- [Tom] Oh Captain Spalding!

619
00:18:54,167 --> 00:18:55,000
- [Joel] Cooking.

620
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,233
Lucky for me,

621
00:18:56,233 --> 00:18:57,800
