625
00:19:01,067 --> 00:19:01,900
Pardon me!
(Crow laughs)

626
00:19:01,900 --> 00:19:02,767
'Scuse me!

627
00:19:02,767 --> 00:19:06,400
(robots slurping)

628
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,033
Uh, just gettin' in here.

629
00:19:08,033 --> 00:19:08,967
'Scuse me!

630
00:19:08,967 --> 00:19:10,000
Just be a moment. (gulps)

631
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,200
Pull in the tail section.

632
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,467
Yup, that's a lot better.

633
00:19:12,467 --> 00:19:14,733
- [Tom] Oh!
I hit somethin'!

634
00:19:16,333 --> 00:19:19,833
- [Tom] (slurps) Oh, Steve,
put my truss back on!

635
00:19:19,833 --> 00:19:20,667
- [Joel] Slip of the tongue,

636
00:19:20,667 --> 00:19:21,500
that's what I do!

637
00:19:21,500 --> 00:19:22,433
(snake tail rattles)

638
00:19:22,433 --> 00:19:24,033
- [Tom] Huh?
(dramatic music)

639
00:19:24,033 --> 00:19:24,933
Uh-oh.

640
00:19:24,933 --> 00:19:26,400
Is that you?

641
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:27,733
- [Joel] Come on, old man,
let's mix it up a bit!

642
00:19:27,733 --> 00:19:29,467
What do you say?

643
00:19:29,467 --> 00:19:31,933
- It's a rattler! (muttering)

644
00:19:31,933 --> 00:19:33,667
- [Joel] I'm your worst
nightmare, old timer!

645
00:19:33,667 --> 00:19:35,233
Come on, mix it up!

646
00:19:39,767 --> 00:19:40,833
- [Tom] What's he doin'?

647
00:19:40,833 --> 00:19:42,600
- [Joel] Ah, come on!

648
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:47,500
- [Tom] Ooh! Stupid old snake!

649
00:19:49,267 --> 00:19:50,533
Ooh!
- [Crow] I'm gonna turn you

650
00:19:50,533 --> 00:19:52,333
