653
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:57,700
Had to use a stick!

654
00:19:57,700 --> 00:19:58,667
Come on!

655
00:19:58,667 --> 00:20:00,100
Man to man, me and you!

656
00:20:00,100 --> 00:20:01,033
Oh, yeah, don't oh!

657
00:20:01,033 --> 00:20:02,600
Thanks a lot!

658
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:03,833
Ow, owie!

659
00:20:03,833 --> 00:20:04,733
Oh, oh, oh!

660
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:06,433
- [Crow] Stupid old snake!

661
00:20:06,433 --> 00:20:08,267
You ruined everything!

662
00:20:09,833 --> 00:20:11,167
- [Tom] Welcome to
America, snakie!

663
00:20:11,167 --> 00:20:12,533
Tell your friends!

664
00:20:12,533 --> 00:20:14,767
- [Crow] He did the mamba mambo!

665
00:20:14,767 --> 00:20:18,233
(Tom chuckles and sighs)

666
00:20:19,167 --> 00:20:20,100
- [Crow] Now where were we?

667
00:20:20,100 --> 00:20:20,900
I believe I had my tongue

668
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:21,833
