669
00:20:21,833 --> 00:20:22,633
- Are you all right, Betty?

670
00:20:22,633 --> 00:20:23,900
- I'm all right, Lewis!

671
00:20:23,900 --> 00:20:25,600
- [Tom] Oh, get me my
nitro pills, would you?

672
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:28,367
- You're not afraid of anything!

673
00:20:28,367 --> 00:20:29,967
Not anything!

674
00:20:29,967 --> 00:20:31,633
- [Joel] Except our intimacy.
- [Tom] Hm.

675
00:20:31,633 --> 00:20:33,833
- [Joel] Boy, I
hate these 4:00 AMs!

676
00:20:33,833 --> 00:20:36,233
(Tom yawns)

677
00:20:36,233 --> 00:20:37,200
(upbeat music)
- [Tom] Hey!

678
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:38,533
Campus cafeteria!

679
00:20:38,533 --> 00:20:40,167
Snazzy name for a hot club, huh?

680
00:20:40,167 --> 00:20:41,300
- [Crow] Yeah!

681
00:20:45,067 --> 00:20:46,033
- [Tom] Hey, guys,

682
00:20:46,033 --> 00:20:47,800
