685
00:20:52,133 --> 00:20:54,867
- [Tom] Dave Junior
and the Kids.

686
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:00,667
That's a big sound for 16.

687
00:21:00,667 --> 00:21:02,167
- [Crow] So that's
when we frag 'em!

688
00:21:02,167 --> 00:21:04,467
What do you say? (grumbles)

689
00:21:04,467 --> 00:21:05,400
- [Tom] I am Queasy.

690
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:06,833
I can't stop turning my neck!

691
00:21:06,833 --> 00:21:07,667
See?

692
00:21:07,667 --> 00:21:09,300
Look!

693
00:21:09,300 --> 00:21:10,567
