cup of chamomile tea?

750
00:22:46,333 --> 00:22:48,900
Then you should join
us at the Old School.

751
00:22:48,900 --> 00:22:50,367
- Yes, it's the Old School.

752
00:22:50,367 --> 00:22:52,733
As seen on Playstar
Productions' hit movie,

753
00:22:52,733 --> 00:22:54,267
Ring of Terror.

754
00:22:54,267 --> 00:22:55,767
Now let's acquaint you
with some of the features

755
00:22:55,767 --> 00:22:57,833
at this fine university.

756
00:22:57,833 --> 00:22:58,767
Joel?

757
00:22:58,767 --> 00:23:00,500
- Why, thank you, Thomas!

758
00:23:00,500 --> 00:23:03,900
This campus sprawls
beautifully, but safely,

759
00:23:03,900 --> 00:23:05,900
over one tenth of a square mile,

760
00:23:05,900 --> 00:23:07,967
nestled between the
Irene Rye Hip Clinic

761
00:23:07,967 --> 00:23:11,067
and the Royal Gear Institute
for Truss Research.

762
00:23:11,067 --> 00:23:12,100
Mister Crow?

763
00:23:12,100 --> 00:23:12,933
- Thank you,

764
00:23:12,933 --> 00:23:14,167
Sir.

765
00:23:14,167 --> 00:23:15,400
You just finished with
one of Doctor Rayburn's

766
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:17,533
fine lectures on blue rinses,

767
00:23:17,533 --> 00:23:19,733
and you and your walker
are spoilin' for fun!

768
00:23:19,733 --> 00:23:20,900
Hey, why not head down,

769
00:23:20,900 --> 00:23:22,167
slowly,

770
00:23:22,167 --> 00:23:24,000
to the athletic facility
located just off

771
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:25,667
War Story Park?

772
00:23:25,667 --> 00:23:26,900
The school team, the Larks,

773
00:23:26,900 --> 00:23:29,467
look forward to another
terrific season!

774
00:23:29,467 --> 00:23:31,833
- Cheer them on from your
backa lounger in the bleachers,

775
00:23:31,833 --> 00:23:33,000
as you do the nod!

776
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,100
Or belt out the school song,

777
00:23:35,100 --> 00:23:37,133
"It's a good day for a BM!"

778
00:23:37,133 --> 00:23:38,367
- You know,

779
00:23:38,367 --> 00:23:40,267
these kids really know
how to have a good time!

780
00:23:40,267 --> 00:23:41,700
It's not uncommon at all

781
00:23:41,700 --> 00:23:44,200
for the more excited winners
to dump a whole cooler

782
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:46,767
of Gera on their
unwitting coach's head!

783
00:23:46,767 --> 00:23:48,000
(robots chuckle)

784
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,367
But, you know, it's
not all fun and games

785
00:23:49,367 --> 00:23:50,867
for these oldsters!

786
00:23:50,867 --> 00:23:53,500
The curriculum's
tough, tough, tough!

787
00:23:53,500 --> 00:23:54,433
- That's right!

788
00:23:54,433 --> 00:23:55,700
There's Napping 111

789
00:23:55,700 --> 00:23:57,367
with the fearsome
Doctor Prowler,

790
00:23:57,367 --> 00:24:00,333
a man so mean, he once
expelled an entire class

791
00:24:00,333 --> 00:24:01,967
