792
00:24:01,967 --> 00:24:03,800
- [Tom] There is
upper-level soup slurping!

793
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:06,100
And advanced Check-paying
and Tip-shorting!

794
00:24:06,100 --> 00:24:08,067
- [Joel] Corn Sanding
and Bunion Counseling

795
00:24:08,067 --> 00:24:09,300
right on campus!

796
00:24:09,300 --> 00:24:10,967
- [Crow] And when your
grandkids come to visit,

797
00:24:10,967 --> 00:24:13,833
you'll receive a
fully-researched
dossier on each of 'em

798
00:24:13,833 --> 00:24:15,100
so you can tell them apart!

799
00:24:15,100 --> 00:24:16,300
- But that's not all!

800
00:24:16,300 --> 00:24:18,200
Last year, the lecture
council brought in

801
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:19,467
