802
00:24:19,467 --> 00:24:21,633
Among them is Estelle
Getty, Lawrence Welk,

803
00:24:21,633 --> 00:24:23,500
Laird Brooks Schmidt,
Art Linkletter,

804
00:24:23,500 --> 00:24:25,733
and, inexpicably,
Garrett Morris.

805
00:24:25,733 --> 00:24:27,667
- [Crow] Huh?
- So, send for your free

806
00:24:27,667 --> 00:24:28,767
catalog today!

807
00:24:28,767 --> 00:24:29,700
Join us

808
00:24:29,700 --> 00:24:30,967
at the Old School!

809
00:24:30,967 --> 00:24:31,900
Our motto:

810
00:24:31,900 --> 00:24:35,233
(speaking Latin),

811
00:24:35,233 --> 00:24:36,467
which means,

812
00:24:36,467 --> 00:24:38,867
"Let's get rid of those
annoying liver spots!"

813
00:24:38,867 --> 00:24:40,767
And remember, if you're over 50,

814
00:24:40,767 --> 00:24:43,567
you cannot be turned down!

815
00:24:43,567 --> 00:24:47,067
(upbeat electronic music)

816
00:24:50,467 --> 00:24:51,733
(upbeat music)

817
00:24:51,733 --> 00:24:53,300
Hey, let's say we bust loose

818
00:24:53,300 --> 00:24:55,067
and get some nice hot basket!

819
00:24:55,067 --> 00:24:56,800
(robots giggle)

820
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:57,967
- [Crow] Hey, let's
look at the girls!

821
00:24:57,967 --> 00:25:00,900
(Joel and robots cat-calling)

822
00:25:00,900 --> 00:25:01,733
- [Tom] You'll stand up,

823
00:25:01,733 --> 00:25:03,133
not me, though.

824
00:25:03,133 --> 00:25:04,667
(students chatter)
- [Crow] Hey, quit moving

825
00:25:04,667 --> 00:25:06,333
