tell that Moffitt.

827
00:25:09,133 --> 00:25:10,433
He rarely messes with
anybody or anything.

828
00:25:10,433 --> 00:25:12,133
- [Tom] Hm.

829
00:25:12,133 --> 00:25:13,300
Strange.
(students mumble)

830
00:25:13,300 --> 00:25:14,567
- You're forgetting
Betty Crocker!

831
00:25:14,567 --> 00:25:15,900
- [Tom] Betty Crocker?
What she sees in him,

832
00:25:15,900 --> 00:25:17,767
I'll never know.

833
00:25:17,767 --> 00:25:18,667
She's beautiful.

834
00:25:18,667 --> 00:25:19,700
And smart, too.

835
00:25:19,700 --> 00:25:20,933
- [Crow] And boy can she cook!

836
00:25:20,933 --> 00:25:22,033
- Yes, she's very
devoted to him!

837
00:25:22,033 --> 00:25:24,100
Doesn't play the field!

838
00:25:24,100 --> 00:25:25,300
Like some girls I know!

839
00:25:25,300 --> 00:25:26,567
- [Joel] What a burn!

840
00:25:26,567 --> 00:25:27,933
