house tomorrow night?

841
00:25:27,933 --> 00:25:28,867
- Yeah, with Lewis.

842
00:25:28,867 --> 00:25:30,167
- He won't be there!

843
00:25:30,167 --> 00:25:31,733
Not if the autopsy's
for tomorrow night.

844
00:25:31,733 --> 00:25:32,667
(Tom smacks kiss)

845
00:25:32,667 --> 00:25:34,267
- Him and 15 other guys!

846
00:25:34,267 --> 00:25:36,733
All of you will be dancing
with tears in your eyes,

847
00:25:36,733 --> 00:25:39,033
