your arms is a girl!

848
00:25:39,033 --> 00:25:40,500
- [Tom] Sounds good to me!

849
00:25:40,500 --> 00:25:42,400
- You doctors-to-be always
spoil our social life

850
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:44,100
