studying routines!

851
00:25:44,100 --> 00:25:45,900
- All part of a
doctor's training!

852
00:25:45,900 --> 00:25:48,433
Getting used to the irregular
hours of a doctor's life!

853
00:25:48,433 --> 00:25:50,133
- [Tom] And just getting
used to being irregular!

854
00:25:50,133 --> 00:25:53,567
- Oh, here they come now!
- [Tom] Hm!

855
00:25:53,567 --> 00:25:54,767
- [Tom] Look, gang.

856
00:25:54,767 --> 00:25:56,267
- Gee, it looks like
she's just seen a ghost!

857
00:25:56,267 --> 00:25:57,567
- [Crow] Or a snake!

858
00:25:57,567 --> 00:25:59,333
- [Tom] Hey, we just
finished making out

859
00:25:59,333 --> 00:26:00,733
