860
00:26:00,733 --> 00:26:02,067
- Hey, gang, what's new?

861
00:26:02,067 --> 00:26:04,733
- [Crow] Not us!
(students chatter)

862
00:26:04,733 --> 00:26:05,933
- [Alice] We thought you
took her to the morgue

863
00:26:05,933 --> 00:26:07,433
