number? (laughs)

889
00:26:51,700 --> 00:26:53,667
(robots laugh and groan)

890
00:26:53,667 --> 00:26:55,100
- It wasn't that, Tiny!

891
00:26:55,100 --> 00:26:57,267
I wrote that one
about five years ago!

892
00:26:57,267 --> 00:27:01,433
- [Joel] (mumbles) Chinese!
(student chatters)

893
00:27:02,500 --> 00:27:03,633
- Come on, let's eat.

894
00:27:03,633 --> 00:27:04,900
- [Crow] Hey,
where's my diet cola?

895
00:27:04,900 --> 00:27:07,667
(dishes clatter)

896
00:27:08,600 --> 00:27:10,867
- [Joel] Mm-mm.
- This is great!

897
00:27:10,867 --> 00:27:12,733
- [Joel] Yeah.

898
00:27:12,733 --> 00:27:13,867
- Cy-form tablets.

899
00:27:13,867 --> 00:27:15,367
Help to keep the weight down!

900
00:27:15,367 --> 00:27:17,133
I gotta make that fraternity!

901
00:27:17,133 --> 00:27:19,800
- [Tom] We've secretly
switched Tiny's coffee

902
00:27:19,800 --> 00:27:22,100
