Brookline gravy!

903
00:27:22,100 --> 00:27:23,700
Let's watch and
see what happens!

904
00:27:23,700 --> 00:27:26,033
(robot gags and all laugh)

905
00:27:26,033 --> 00:27:28,067
- [Joel] Let a whole
bunch of fat puns loose

906
00:27:28,067 --> 00:27:29,867
and it's still acceptable
to laugh at it.

907
00:27:29,867 --> 00:27:32,433
(robots chuckle)

908
00:27:32,433 --> 00:27:33,433
- [Tom] Hey!

909
00:27:34,633 --> 00:27:36,033
- You know what?

910
00:27:36,033 --> 00:27:37,467
I hear that music is a real

911
00:27:37,467 --> 00:27:40,000
fine form of exercise!
- [Crow] Let's eat some!

912
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:41,600
Especially dancing to it, too!

913
00:27:41,600 --> 00:27:42,433
You wanna?

914
00:27:42,433 --> 00:27:43,733
- Sure!

915
00:27:43,733 --> 00:27:44,400
(Joel slurps)
- [Tom] Finish it off, Joel.

916
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:46,667
(Joel slurps)

917
00:27:46,667 --> 00:27:48,000
- [Joel] Looks like a precursor

918
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,267
