919
00:27:49,267 --> 00:27:50,767
- [Tom] Yee-hoo!

920
00:27:50,767 --> 00:27:52,600
Oh that's real chubby!

921
00:27:52,600 --> 00:27:54,967
♪ Rattle, rattle,
thunder clatter, ♪

922
00:27:54,967 --> 00:27:56,433
♪ boom, boom, boom ♪

923
00:27:56,433 --> 00:27:58,633
- [Tom] Oh, no, that's me.

924
00:27:59,933 --> 00:28:00,767
Whoo!

925
00:28:00,767 --> 00:28:01,700
What's goin' on here?

926
00:28:01,700 --> 00:28:02,933
- [Crow] Praying mantis!

927
00:28:02,933 --> 00:28:05,667
- [Joel] Oh, even I've
gotta laugh! (chuckles)

928
00:28:05,667 --> 00:28:06,967
- [Tom] An interpretive
dance showing

929
00:28:06,967 --> 00:28:09,167
