930
00:28:10,367 --> 00:28:11,300
- [Joel] Chortle.

931
00:28:11,300 --> 00:28:14,567
Chortle.
(Tom rattles)

932
00:28:16,333 --> 00:28:17,400
- [Crow] We really
are cool cats!

933
00:28:17,400 --> 00:28:18,633
- [Tom] Yeah, they are.

934
00:28:18,633 --> 00:28:19,300
- [Joel] Even the truck
driver and his chicks

935
00:28:19,300 --> 00:28:20,567
gotta laugh!

936
00:28:20,567 --> 00:28:22,767
- [Crow] Okay, now who's
makin' a trumpet noise?

937
00:28:22,767 --> 00:28:24,300
I don't see no trumpet.

938
00:28:24,300 --> 00:28:25,100
- [Joel] They're laughing
through their instruments!

939
00:28:25,100 --> 00:28:26,833
- [Tom] I can tell.

940
00:28:26,833 --> 00:28:28,000
Ugh, look out.

941
00:28:29,100 --> 00:28:30,233
Thump.

942
00:28:30,233 --> 00:28:34,367
Yep, yep, yep. (chuckles)

943
00:28:34,367 --> 00:28:35,933
At least they're having
a good time, you know?

944
00:28:35,933 --> 00:28:37,567
- [Joel] That's a
good stroke candidate.

945
00:28:37,567 --> 00:28:39,600
(students laughing)

946
00:28:39,600 --> 00:28:41,100
Oh, you were enjoyed!
- [Tom] Mm-hm.

947
00:28:41,100 --> 00:28:45,067
- [Tom] Meanwhile in the Edith
Evans College for Grown-Ups.

948
00:28:46,267 --> 00:28:47,967
- The frosh look like
they're gonna provide

949
00:28:47,967 --> 00:28:49,300
a lot of kicks
these year, Howard!

950
00:28:49,300 --> 00:28:50,733
- [Tom] These year?

951
00:28:50,733 --> 00:28:51,767
He said these year.
- [Man] What are you gonna

952
00:28:51,767 --> 00:28:53,200
