budding medics!

955
00:28:55,900 --> 00:28:57,533
- [Crow] We're thinkin'
of takin' advantage

956
00:28:57,533 --> 00:28:58,767
of the freshmen's osteoporosis!

957
00:28:58,767 --> 00:28:59,700
- I even got a
hold of some stunts

958
00:28:59,700 --> 00:29:00,567
tried out at Yale and Cornell!

959
00:29:00,567 --> 00:29:02,100
Not to mention

960
00:29:02,100 --> 00:29:04,667
jolly old Oxford!
(Joel and robots groan)

961
00:29:04,667 --> 00:29:06,767
- They even have one from
the University of Naples,

962
00:29:06,767 --> 00:29:08,600
which dates way, way back!

963
00:29:08,600 --> 00:29:09,833
- Bella Napoli!

964
00:29:10,867 --> 00:29:11,967
So whatta ya gotta Faizani

965
00:29:11,967 --> 00:29:13,967
- [Tom] Shut up!

966
00:29:13,967 --> 00:29:15,067
- To tell you the truth,
it's pretty gruesome.

967
00:29:15,067 --> 00:29:16,500
I'd hate to be one of the fellas

968
00:29:16,500 --> 00:29:17,233
on the receiving end!
- [Tom] Isn't that Don DeFor

969
00:29:17,233 --> 00:29:18,400
from TV's Hazel?

970
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:19,467
- Wow, that's terrific!

971
00:29:19,467 --> 00:29:20,500
Hey, what (mumbles)?

972
00:29:20,500 --> 00:29:22,067
- Nuh-uh, buddy.

973
00:29:22,067 --> 00:29:23,067
Not with meeting!

974
00:29:23,067 --> 00:29:24,067
'Sides, we can't
give the pledges

975
00:29:24,067 --> 00:29:25,333
out their routines

976
00:29:25,333 --> 00:29:27,033
until after I sit
down and make out

977
00:29:27,033 --> 00:29:28,267
their first autopsy!

978
00:29:28,267 --> 00:29:29,367
- [Joel] Probably
hates them too!

979
00:29:29,367 --> 00:29:30,367
- [Crow] You mean autopsy!

980
00:29:30,367 --> 00:29:31,300
- We'll meet tonight!

981
00:29:31,300 --> 00:29:32,700
(upperclassman muttering loudly)

982
00:29:32,700 --> 00:29:33,800
- [Joel] Kill that guy!
- [Tom] Kill him!

983
00:29:33,800 --> 00:29:35,267
- [Crow and Tom] Kill him!

984
00:29:35,267 --> 00:29:37,267
- [Joel] Hey, come on, you guys!

985
00:29:37,267 --> 00:29:38,733
There's a fire at the
mort sci building!

986
00:29:38,733 --> 00:29:41,400
- [Tom] Hm.
- [Crow] Get the marshmallows!

987
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:43,100
- [Lewis] Professor Rayburn!

988
00:29:43,100 --> 00:29:44,667
- Hello, Moffitt!
- [Tom] How's the toffit?

989
00:29:44,667 --> 00:29:47,067
- Professor Rayburn, may
I ask a favor of you?

990
00:29:47,067 --> 00:29:48,367
- Why certainly, what is it?

991
00:29:48,367 --> 00:29:49,367
- [Joel] Uh, is it okay
if I kiss up to you?

992
00:29:49,367 --> 00:29:50,667
- (mutters) to use a student

993
00:29:50,667 --> 00:29:52,000
to assist you at your autopsies.

994
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:54,067
- Yes, but that
shouldn't concern you.

995
00:29:54,067 --> 00:29:55,367
I usually pick seniors!
- [Tom] I never want

996
00:29:55,367 --> 00:29:56,867
anyone that's older than me.

997
00:29:56,867 --> 00:29:59,333
- If I might help you.

998
00:29:59,333 --> 00:30:00,733
- That's odd!

999
00:30:00,733 --> 00:30:02,400
Most of the fellas
try to dodge it!

1000
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:04,000
- [Crow] Why, you
couldn't be a day over 40!

1001
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,933
- They give me all kinds
of lame-duck excuses!

1002
00:30:05,933 --> 00:30:08,067
From a heart condition
to athlete's foot!

1003
00:30:08,067 --> 00:30:11,333
- [Joel] Alzheimers
to broken hips!

1004
00:30:11,333 --> 00:30:12,600
- Well, may I, sir?

1005
00:30:12,600 --> 00:30:13,600
- All right!

1006
00:30:14,633 --> 00:30:16,633
I'll tell you what you do.

1007
00:30:16,633 --> 00:30:19,167
You, uh, you go by the
morgue, just before class,

1008
00:30:19,167 --> 00:30:21,067
and slip into a surgical gown.

1009
00:30:21,067 --> 00:30:22,000
- [Crow] And that's all.
(Lewis and professor mutter)

1010
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:23,200
Then take a cold shower

1011
00:30:23,200 --> 00:30:24,467
and hop up on a slab!

1012
00:30:24,467 --> 00:30:25,300
- Well, thank you very much.

1013
00:30:25,300 --> 00:30:26,700
I appreciate it, sir.

1014
00:30:26,700 --> 00:30:30,267
- [Tom] What a jerk.
- [Crow] Oh, to be 40 again!

1015
00:30:31,567 --> 00:30:32,800
- [Crow] Idiot!

