2023
01:00:40,533 --> 01:00:41,533
Wait a minute!

2024
01:00:41,533 --> 01:00:42,367
- What do you want?

2025
01:00:42,367 --> 01:00:43,200
- You passed!

2026
01:00:43,200 --> 01:00:44,033
- Yeah?

2027
01:00:44,033 --> 01:00:45,000
- I was just kidding ya.

2028
01:00:45,000 --> 01:00:45,833
You passed your initiation!

2029
01:00:45,833 --> 01:00:47,033
