2030
01:00:47,033 --> 01:00:48,467
- Yeah?
- [Tom] Well thank ya, Kensie!

2031
01:00:48,467 --> 01:00:49,433
- [Joel] Keep your
feet on the ground

2032
01:00:49,433 --> 01:00:51,367
